WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.726 --> 00:00:18.909
watched as the fake Wujing fed the horse some hay.

2
00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:24.272
"I don't know how you made fake versions of us, Wukong," said the purple spirit.

3
00:00:24.292 --> 00:00:28.816
"But you won't get the True Scriptures without the real Tang Monk."

4
00:00:29.816 --> 00:00:31.517
Wukong folded his arms.

5
00:00:31.537 --> 00:00:33.479
"Oh yes, I will."

6
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.162
Wujing leaped into the air and flew south.

7
00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:42.585
"I'll tell the bodhisattva what Wukong is doing," he thought.

8
00:00:42.605 --> 00:00:44.426
"She can stop him."

9
00:00:46.388 --> 00:00:50.431
When Wujing arrived at Mount Potalaka, he was even more shocked.

10
00:00:52.012 --> 00:00:55.054
Wukong was meditating in the bodhisattva's garden.

11
00:00:55.074 --> 00:00:58.572
"Wukong!" cried Wujing.

12
00:00:58.592 --> 00:01:00.073
"How did you get here so fast?"

13
00:01:01.013 --> 00:01:02.294
"What are you talking about?"

14
00:01:02.574 --> 00:01:03.215
asked the monkey.

15
00:01:04.716 --> 00:01:05.936
came out of her pagoda.

16
00:01:09.838 --> 00:01:10.839
what are you doing here?"

17
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.360
purple spirit bowed.

18
00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:15.962
"Bodhisattva, I must speak with you.

19
00:01:17.163 --> 00:01:20.805
Wukong has made fake versions of me, Bajie, and the Tang Monk.

20
00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:23.686
He's planning to make the journey without us."

21
00:01:23.706 --> 00:01:26.528
"What!" shouted Wukong.

22
00:01:27.392 --> 00:01:29.033
Wujing glanced at the monkey.

23
00:01:29.053 --> 00:01:31.956
"I just saw him on the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

24
00:01:33.097 --> 00:01:35.298
I don't know how he got here before me."

25
00:01:35.318 --> 00:01:38.641
"You're lying!"

26
00:01:38.861 --> 00:01:39.782
yelled Wukong.

27
00:01:40.643 --> 00:01:41.804
Guanyin smiled.

28
00:01:41.824 --> 00:01:43.625
"You're mistaken, Wujing.

29
00:01:43.645 --> 00:01:46.427
Wukong has been here the whole time."

30
00:01:47.468 --> 00:01:48.849
Wujing was surprised.

31
00:01:48.869 --> 00:01:49.690
"He has?"

32
00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:52.172
Guanyin nodded.

33
00:01:53.593 --> 00:01:54.954
Wukong made a fist.

34
00:01:55.755 --> 00:01:56.876
is pretending to be me!

35
00:01:57.696 --> 00:01:59.197
And he's living on my mountain!

36
00:02:00.759 --> 00:02:01.880
going there right now.

37
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.781
I'm going to destroy him!"

38
00:02:03.861 --> 00:02:06.664
"I'll go with you," said Wujing.

39
00:02:11.688 --> 00:02:15.151
Wukong and Wujing soon arrived on the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

40
00:02:18.454 --> 00:02:22.197
The monkey's eyes burned with anger when he saw the fake Wukong.

41
00:02:22.217 --> 00:02:23.979
"Who are you?"

42
00:02:24.259 --> 00:02:25.320
demanded Wukong.

43
00:02:26.892 --> 00:02:29.574
"Who are asked the fake Wukong.

44
00:02:29.594 --> 00:02:34.058
"I am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain!"

45
00:02:38.502 --> 00:02:39.402
said the other monkey.

46
00:02:40.603 --> 00:02:43.225
am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain!"

47
00:02:44.566 --> 00:02:47.509
Furious, Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

48
00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.512
The fake Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

49
00:02:55.115 --> 00:02:57.873
Wukong attacked, and so did the fake Wukong.

50
00:02:59.814 --> 00:03:02.975
The ground shook as the iron bars crashed into each other.

51
00:03:03.635 --> 00:03:05.676
The two monkeys fought with fury.

52
00:03:07.957 --> 00:03:10.999
Wujing watched as one Wukong struck the other.

53
00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:16.041
The other Wukong blocked the bar and swung back.

54
00:03:18.882 --> 00:03:20.763
"Wujing, help me!"

55
00:03:21.023 --> 00:03:22.184
cried one Wukong.

56
00:03:23.456 --> 00:03:26.957
Wujing raised his spear and was about to enter the fight.

57
00:03:28.037 --> 00:03:29.218
other Wukong shouted.

58
00:03:29.238 --> 00:03:30.198
"No, Wujing!

59
00:03:30.338 --> 00:03:34.939
Help looked from one Wukong to the other.

60
00:03:34.959 --> 00:03:38.860
"Who is the real Wukong?"

61
00:03:40.301 --> 00:03:40.781
"I am!"

62
00:03:41.081 --> 00:03:43.721
shouted one Wukong as he struck at the other.

63
00:03:45.302 --> 00:03:48.703
"No!" shouted the other Wukong, blocking the first one's attack.

64
00:03:49.723 --> 00:03:51.944
am!" "Don't listen to him!"

65
00:03:52.144 --> 00:03:53.024
cried one monkey.

66
00:03:54.436 --> 00:03:56.517
"Don't listen to cried the other.

67
00:04:01.019 --> 00:04:01.939
stamped his foot.

68
00:04:02.579 --> 00:04:04.140
"Stop fighting!"

69
00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:04.780
he shouted.

70
00:04:06.141 --> 00:04:07.701
both monkeys stopped fighting.

71
00:04:08.422 --> 00:04:09.982
They looked at the purple spirit.

72
00:04:10.042 --> 00:04:14.124
"I don't know which one of you is the real Wukong," said Wujing.

73
00:04:15.385 --> 00:04:16.425
to Mount Potalaka.

74
00:04:16.925 --> 00:04:18.886
Guanyin will be able to tell who is who.

75
00:04:19.846 --> 00:04:22.728
I will return to the Tang Monk to tell him what's going on."

76
00:04:23.916 --> 00:04:26.418
The two Wukongs glanced at each other.

77
00:04:26.438 --> 00:04:29.241
"That's a good idea," said one of them.

78
00:04:29.261 --> 00:04:33.205
"Guanyin will easily see that I am the real Wukong."

79
00:04:33.225 --> 00:04:37.328
"It a good idea," the other agreed.

80
00:04:37.348 --> 00:04:41.372
"Guanyin will easily see that am the real Wukong."

81
00:04:44.174 --> 00:04:46.797
Soon the two Wukongs stood before Guanyin.

82
00:04:48.138 --> 00:04:49.960
She looked carefully at each one.

83
00:04:50.972 --> 00:04:54.295
"I can't tell which one of you is the real Wukong," she said.

84
00:04:56.257 --> 00:04:57.858
Wukong took a deep breath.

85
00:04:57.878 --> 00:05:00.200
"Use the Tight Headband spell.

86
00:05:01.021 --> 00:05:04.164
The spell will work only with my headband—the real headband."

87
00:05:06.046 --> 00:05:06.806
said the other one.

88
00:05:06.826 --> 00:05:08.628
"Use the Tight Headband spell!

89
00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:11.410
The spell will only work with headband."
